  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with internet humor, irony, and self-deprecating comedy. It relies on the universal understanding of theft as a negative act and the cultural symbolism of angels as divine reward, making it accessible to people across demographics who understand the absurdity of equating a short period of non-theft with angelic status. The target community includes individuals who engage with memes, appreciate visual humor, and are comfortable with self-referential or satirical content.",
